WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.900
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.400
Start a new task

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.500
Type it in one line: what, when, #project, !priority

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.000
The date, project and priority are read as you type

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.800
Add Task

6
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.300
It went to the project you named…

7
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.800
…Home Renovation

8
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:42.300
…and there it is, with its day, time and priority
